---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy | Medical Rank" description="What information medical-rank.com collects and how it is used.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="pagehead">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="lede">This site collects very little. This page says exactly what.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Reading the site</h2>
      <p>The site does not use advertising trackers or analytics scripts. Our hosting provider, Cloudflare, processes standard request information such as your IP address in order to deliver pages and protect the site.</p>
      <h2>Contacting us</h2>
      <p>If you email us or use the contact form, we receive what you send: your name, practice name, website, email address and message. We use it to reply to you. We do not sell it or add you to a mailing list.</p>
      <p>Please do not send patient information. We do not need it to talk about your marketing.</p>
      <h2>Questions or removal</h2>
      <p>To ask what we hold about you or to have it deleted, write to <a href="mailto:info@medical-rank.com">info@medical-rank.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
